# PLACEHOLDER book (workstream Q). Not story: Steven writes the real book.
# One line = one page. A line followed by responses is a branch point: the choices print at the
# foot of that page. Grammar: design/godot-dialogue.md "Books".

~ start
PLACEHOLDER page 1.
PLACEHOLDER page 2 (a branch point).
- PLACEHOLDER choice A
	PLACEHOLDER page A1.
	PLACEHOLDER page A2.
	=> ending
- PLACEHOLDER choice B
	PLACEHOLDER page B1.
	=> ending

~ ending
PLACEHOLDER last page (the ending).
set placeholder_book_finished = true
=> END
